### 查询用户总数（先跑这个，记住当前值）
GET http://localhost:8080/users/count

### 新增一个用户
POST http://localhost:8080/users?nickname=zhaoliu&schoolNo=2023004

### 查询所有用户
GET http://localhost:8080/users
### 修改存在的用户
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/3?nickname=xiaowang&credit=95

### 修改不存在的用户
PUT http://localhost:8080/users/9999?nickname=abc&credit=50
### 删除用户
DELETE http://localhost:8080/users/4

### 查被删的用户
GET http://localhost:8080/users/4